{"sha":"54dd6d4f2075ca428b1f3a5a8c50114351ea4755","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKDU0ZGQ2ZDRmMjA3NWNhNDI4YjFmM2E1YThjNTAxMTQzNTFlYTQ3NTU","commit":{"author":{"name":"yanki-m","email":"yanki@caura.ai","date":"2026-08-23T17:59:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-23T17:59:31Z"},"message":"feat(assets): the repo's social preview is Caura (Phase C) (#887)\n\nPhase C of the rebrand: the repository's social preview.\n\nTwo commits, deliberately separate:\n\n1. **Rename** — `static/images/memclaw-social-preview.png` →\n`caura-social-preview.png`. No file in the tree references either name.\n2. **Re-render** — the card itself. The wordmark now reads **Caura**;\nthe chips (Apache 2.0 · MCP-native · Self-hosted · Managed), the\nheadline and the eToro proof line are unchanged. Resolution doubles from\n1280×640 to **2560×1280** — GitHub's recommended size is 1280×640, so\nthis is the 2× asset on the required 2:1 aspect and renders sharp on\nhigh-DPI displays rather than being upscaled.\n\nThe first commit's message said it changed the filename and not the\ncard. The second changes the card.\n\n## One step remains, and no commit can do it\n\nThe preview GitHub actually serves comes from its own CDN and is set by\na **manual upload under Settings → Social preview**. Until someone does\nthat, every link to this repo posted in Slack, X or LinkedIn still\nunfurls with the old wordmark, regardless of what is in\n`static/images/`.\n\nMerging this PR does not close Phase C. **The upload closes Phase C.**\n\n## Why it matters\n\nThis is the most-seen unrebranded surface the project has: it renders on\nevery share of the repo, and unlike site pages there is no redirect or\nbridge text softening it — the old brand is simply the picture.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Yanki <yanki@caura.ai>","tree":{"sha":"5d8198c4b075fd45d978c8b9b0af06ce435c47d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/5d8198c4b075fd45d978c8b9b0af06ce435c47d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/54dd6d4f2075ca428b1f3a5a8c50114351ea4755","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqizUDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3EYQAAtkTN75Wba1lFhSVh3huuwo\nr3oV1zRU517ePl6QhglQrkEV/sKv6TUDhE79hvzn2vZJdHyaEiFMcNpc96GtEjwB\nuwiU31V6wvlT32uhlq9yH9GEaCqoy0FFcTuPNlYyk2M0GoOvy4isvY6q84JMS96l\nSfVGAC3Lu0KgGSQO1DWJi0t0IQdOIEMz/2NNxFoqOuoGfWPckgw9pLZ/JKiKfcFn\naBLeME7nvj1lOLy9MMvlKlxq7HDg6rOoAX/VGS6f5bIL3VTWK5IQZXKdVWnfcmHf\nVrrDkzjXBrKXsqtIXimTj+EZxobO8ncK3HpVbfR6XRznHfD9YCb8szHJw9PwuO0z\nLs0k+H6jK5l1M4aEDkPjv/Ot4YEOswxQgm0YcTsx6bf1WeCsbk9wE45Pni8hdCp1\nX5rZjzXdF03l9PuBPo8P+iEuz8i5Iocw8FbdwT4cOMRQiaTW4fOPOpYLz2tFJax5\nTeF5G8KdbMRHhjGVuNb/Z70AtpokmskJKj3xNhmfqSSKktCW7f+cjqNpSzXB/doE\nZuFDgF8PtlFDu1lnaPFqAYsZ+vXXAVaR1iSgg5+j80Sux4vvPryRWoYf/ngWLCbv\nNfOdjRgxtphuBAlgNfKguzcZxNUnTWu6Ag11EeFnJrlVAYRI3xN8Dp2PH3aR5ZY9\n6qMg/t5KW8rGRU6nzF5K\n=PyLn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5d8198c4b075fd45d978c8b9b0af06ce435c47d9\nparent 599b72b3ad99f4c25bf527cb577f5535706fd46e\nauthor yanki-m <yanki@caura.ai> 1787507971 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787507971 +0300\n\nfeat(assets): the repo's social preview is Caura (Phase C) (#887)\n\nPhase C of the rebrand: the repository's social preview.\n\nTwo commits, deliberately separate:\n\n1. **Rename** — `static/images/memclaw-social-preview.png` →\n`caura-social-preview.png`. No file in the tree references either name.\n2. **Re-render** — the card itself. The wordmark now reads **Caura**;\nthe chips (Apache 2.0 · MCP-native · Self-hosted · Managed), the\nheadline and the eToro proof line are unchanged. Resolution doubles from\n1280×640 to **2560×1280** — GitHub's recommended size is 1280×640, so\nthis is the 2× asset on the required 2:1 aspect and renders sharp on\nhigh-DPI displays rather than being upscaled.\n\nThe first commit's message said it changed the filename and not the\ncard. The second changes the card.\n\n## One step remains, and no commit can do it\n\nThe preview GitHub actually serves comes from its own CDN and is set by\na **manual upload under Settings → Social preview**. Until someone does\nthat, every link to this repo posted in Slack, X or LinkedIn still\nunfurls with the old wordmark, regardless of what is in\n`static/images/`.\n\nMerging this PR does not close Phase C. **The upload closes Phase C.**\n\n## Why it matters\n\nThis is the most-seen unrebranded surface the project has: it renders on\nevery share of the repo, and unlike site pages there is no redirect or\nbridge text softening it — the old brand is simply the picture.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Yanki <yanki@caura.ai>","verified_at":"2026-08-23T17:59:32Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/54dd6d4f2075ca428b1f3a5a8c50114351ea4755","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/54dd6d4f2075ca428b1f3a5a8c50114351ea4755","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/54dd6d4f2075ca428b1f3a5a8c50114351ea4755/comments","author":{"login":"yanki-m","id":232570632,"node_id":"U_kgDODdy_CA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232570632?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m","html_url":"https://github.com/yanki-m","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanki-m/events{/privacy}"